---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /ideas/
title: Project ideas for hackathons
description: Concrete project ideas sized for a 24 to 48 hour hackathon, each with the user, the core feature, the demo moment, a suggested stack, difficulty and team size.
scripts: ["/assets/js/ideas.js"]
---
<p class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / Ideas</p>
<h1>Project ideas</h1>
<p class="lede">{{ site.ideas.length }} ideas sized for a weekend hackathon. Each one names who it is for, what it does and the moment that sells it in a demo. Open a card for the full detail, a suggested stack and the team size it suits.</p>

<form class="filters idea-filters" id="idea-filters" onsubmit="return false" hidden>
  <div class="filter-row idea-filter-row">
    <label>Niche
      <select name="niche" id="f-idea-niche">
        <option value="">Any niche</option>
        {%- for n in site.ideaNiches %}
        <option value="{{ n.slug }}">{{ n.name }} ({{ n.count }})</option>
        {%- endfor %}
      </select>
    </label>
    <label>Difficulty
      <select name="difficulty" id="f-idea-difficulty">
        <option value="">Any difficulty</option>
        {%- for d in site.ideaDifficulties %}
        <option value="{{ d.key }}">{{ d.label }} ({{ d.count }})</option>
        {%- endfor %}
      </select>
    </label>
  </div>
  <div class="filter-foot">
    <span id="idea-count" aria-live="polite">{{ site.ideas.length }} ideas</span>
    <button type="button" class="linkbtn" id="idea-reset">Clear filters</button>
  </div>
</form>

<div class="idea-list" id="idea-list">
{%- for idea in site.ideas %}
{% include "idea-card.njk" %}
{%- endfor %}
</div>
<p class="empty" id="idea-none" hidden>No ideas match these filters yet.</p>
<p class="source-note">Seed ideas are written by the hackathon.so team. Generated ideas are added weekly by an AI pipeline, checked in code for length, format and near-duplicates, and labelled with the date they were generated.</p>
